# MEG MMN Project - Day 1 Restart From Continuous SPM File

This folder contains the GitHub-ready code and notes for the **Day 1 restart and trial-definition stage** of the preprocessing pipeline.

## What this covers

This stage restarted preprocessing from the continuous SPM-converted dataset because the existing epoched file had been created with the wrong epoch window.

Completed in this stage:

1. Load the continuous SPM file
2. Inspect the event structure
3. Confirm the correct event stream for trial definition
4. Redefine trials with the correct epoch window
5. Save the new trial-definition file

